{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1708340,
  "courseSlug": "learn-flutter-dart-to-build-ios-android-apps",
  "courseTitle": "Flutter & Dart - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37213800",
      "title": "Getting Form Access via a Global Key",
      "lectureOrder": 217,
      "videoOrder": 201,
      "sourceHash": "94707dade883638303580a4f2d68e3b2fee52c7c54cbbcfd9520205f5304acb3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "So how do we make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "that this validation logic does get executed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 8.76,
          "en": "Well for that we need to tell Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.76,
          "end": 12.66,
          "en": "that for this form it should execute all the validators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.66,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "that are registered for all the form fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 19.47,
          "en": "And doing so is thankfully quite straightforward",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.47,
          "end": 22.83,
          "en": "because you can get access to this form widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.83,
          "end": 26.94,
          "en": "and the underlying object that's managed by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.94,
          "end": 30.213,
          "en": "And you can tell Flutter to validate this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 35.28,
          "en": "Now you do get this access to form through a key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.28,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "and that might be strange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "because we have used keys before in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "but only to uniquely identify,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 45.48,
          "en": "which it's typically when used in a list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "Now here it's the same key parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "but it'll be a different kind of key that we add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 55.565,
          "en": "It'll be a key that we should create as a property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.565,
          "end": 58.95,
          "en": "And I'll name it form key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "and it will be of type global key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "So here I create a new global key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 67.92,
          "en": "by using the global key constructor function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.92,
          "end": 71.195,
          "en": "the global key class which is built into Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.195,
          "end": 76.195,
          "en": "And global key creates a, guess what, global key object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.26,
          "end": 81.123,
          "en": "that can be used as a value for a key as we need it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.23,
          "end": 84.51,
          "en": "Now the difference between a global key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.51,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "and for example a value key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 88.05,
          "en": "which we used before in this course is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.05,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "that a global key here then also gives us easy access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 94.83,
          "en": "to the underlying widget to which it is connected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 98.22,
          "en": "And it ensures that if that build method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 99.66,
          "en": "is executed again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "because we set some state, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 105.50999999999999,
          "en": "this form widget is not rebuilt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.50999999999999,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "and instead keeps its internal state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "which is very important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 113.1,
          "en": "because it's that internal state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 115.56,
          "en": "with which we'll work in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.56,
          "end": 117.9,
          "en": "It's for example that internal state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.9,
          "end": 119.37,
          "en": "that will tell Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.37,
          "end": 123.063,
          "en": "whether to show some validation errors on the screen or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 127.047,
          "en": "That's why such a global key should be created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.047,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "And in general when working with Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "you will almost always only need a global key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.56,
          "en": "for working with forms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 138.81,
          "en": "because you can then also use this global key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.81,
          "end": 140.37,
          "en": "to get access to that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "And that is indeed what we'll do next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.46,
          "end": 145.05,
          "en": "Before doing that though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "I'll add a little state annotation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 151.26,
          "en": "because global key is actually a generic type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.98,
          "en": "and I wanna tell Flutter that the widget or the object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.98,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "to which this global key in the end will be connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.65,
          "en": "will be a form state object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.65,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "That's in the end what this form widget gives us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 166.82999999999998,
          "en": "And this will simply give us some extra type checking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.82999999999998,
          "end": 169.2,
          "en": "and auto completion suggestions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 171.123,
          "en": "So we wanna add this annotation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.98,
          "end": 175.224,
          "en": "With that added, I'll add a new method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 175.224,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "SaveItem sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "And it's this method that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 184.023,
          "en": "once this last button here is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.95,
          "end": 188.22,
          "en": "So here, instead of pointing at an anonymous function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.22,
          "end": 192.45,
          "en": "I'll point at saveItem like this, not executing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.45,
          "end": 193.71,
          "en": "just pointing at it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.71,
          "end": 195.75,
          "en": "so that this function gets executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 195.75,
          "end": 197.193,
          "en": "when this button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 199.53,
          "en": "and it's now in this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.53,
          "end": 202.26,
          "en": "where I wanna trigger validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.26,
          "end": 204.81,
          "en": "And doing so is super straightforward",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.81,
          "end": 206.94,
          "en": "because with that global key added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.94,
          "end": 209.85,
          "en": "and connected to the form, you can use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.85,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "to access the current state property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 214.89,
          "en": "on that form key object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.89,
          "end": 217.82999999999998,
          "en": "and tell Dart that this will never be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 219.48,
          "en": "So in the end you are telling Dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 219.48,
          "end": 223.23,
          "en": "that your form key has been connected to the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 223.23,
          "end": 226.59,
          "en": "And here we know that save item can't execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 226.59,
          "end": 228.63,
          "en": "before this build method has been called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 230.49,
          "en": "And therefore this form has been created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.49,
          "end": 232.47,
          "en": "and the form key attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 235.26,
          "en": "because the only way of executing saveItem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.26,
          "end": 237.32999999999998,
          "en": "is by pressing this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.32999999999998,
          "end": 241.38,
          "en": "That's the only place where we mention saveItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.38,
          "end": 243.9,
          "en": "And at the point of time this button can be pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.9,
          "end": 246.63,
          "en": "the form will of course have been created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.63,
          "end": 249.18,
          "en": "and the form key will of course have been attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.18,
          "end": 250.38,
          "en": "to the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 250.38,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "So therefore in here we know with certainty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 256.14,
          "en": "that this underlying form state object will exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.14,
          "end": 258.18,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we're telling Dart here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 258.18,
          "end": 260.19,
          "en": "with that exclamation mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 260.19,
          "end": 262.77,
          "en": "that this underlying state object will exist",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 262.77,
          "end": 263.793,
          "en": "and is not null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 264.75,
          "end": 266.82,
          "en": "And then on this state object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 266.82,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "we can access various utility methods like for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 275.25,
          "en": "validate, which is a method provided by the form widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 275.25,
          "end": 277.5,
          "en": "in the end, which will automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 277.5,
          "end": 281.15999999999997,
          "en": "behind the scenes reach out to all the form field widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281.15999999999997,
          "end": 284.01,
          "en": "inside of the form like text form field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 284.01,
          "end": 286.995,
          "en": "and execute its validator functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 286.995,
          "end": 289.443,
          "en": "That's what validate will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 290.46,
          "end": 293.284,
          "en": "In addition, validate will return a Boolean value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 293.284,
          "end": 298.284,
          "en": "which will be true if all validator functions passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 298.44,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "or false, if at least one validator function failed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 305.49,
          "en": "and this will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 305.49,
          "end": 308.91,
          "en": "With this added though, we can save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 308.91,
          "end": 311.43,
          "en": "reload and go back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 311.43,
          "end": 314.1,
          "en": "And if I now click add item, I get an error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 314.1,
          "end": 316.05,
          "en": "for the name because it's empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 316.05,
          "end": 319.32,
          "en": "If I enter an invalid quantity like minus one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 319.32,
          "end": 321.58299999999997,
          "en": "I also get an error there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 321.58299999999997,
          "end": 324.06,
          "en": "By the way, speaking of the quantity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 324.06,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "I just see that we should change the keyboard type here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 328.68,
          "en": "So I will quickly do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 328.68,
          "end": 333,
          "en": "Go to the quantity and set the keyboard type here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 333,
          "end": 335.61,
          "en": "to text input type number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 335.61,
          "end": 338.1,
          "en": "This is of course not related to validation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 338.1,
          "end": 339.84000000000003,
          "en": "but something we should do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 339.84000000000003,
          "end": 344.37,
          "en": "but detached from that, we now also get working validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 344.37,
          "end": 346.17,
          "en": "If I do submit valid values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 346.17,
          "end": 349.44,
          "en": "those validation errors of course go away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 349.44,
          "end": 352.29,
          "en": "And that's how we can leverage this form widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 352.29,
          "end": 355.95,
          "en": "combined with this form global key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 355.95,
          "end": 360,
          "en": "to automatically trigger all these validation functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 360,
          "end": 362.91,
          "en": "which might return error messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 362.91,
          "end": 366.09,
          "en": "which are displayed automatically by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 366.09,
          "end": 369.45,
          "en": "And that of course makes form validation much easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 369.45,
          "end": 371.763,
          "en": "than if you have to handle this manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 372.72,
          "end": 374.88,
          "en": "So we learned how we can use the form key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 374.88,
          "end": 377.01,
          "en": "to validate the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 377.01,
          "end": 380.49,
          "en": "We'll soon also use it to save the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 380.49,
          "end": 383.1,
          "en": "and get access to the entered data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 383.1,
          "end": 386.52,
          "en": "But before we do that, we can also use this form key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
